  {
   "rating": 7,
   "date": "2006-03-26T16:52:06-06:00",
   "body": "Take note that you can only get one of these nice buffs at a time.&nbsp; Dunno about if you put the buffs on yourself when you use the items.&nbsp; But when you turn the quest in, and he buffs you, you get one buff.&nbsp; So if you decide to turn in a whole bunch of quests at once for the items and xp... choose your favorite buff for last.&nbsp; =)",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 7,
   "date": "2020-03-13T08:20:15-05:00",
   "body": "If you don't see any kill of the critters you need start killing ALL the felbeasts in the area. Then Helboar, buzzards, scorpids and basilisks etc will take the opened spawn locations. If you ignore the Felbeasts they will take over all the spawn locations and make the spawns you need more rare.\r\n\r\nDon't understand why more people don't understand this!",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 6,
